course: dictionary
lesson: 2556
title: Delay: a word for time
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A delay is a time when something happens later than planned. You may see it on a station board or hear it in an announcement: «There is a delay to the 9:15 train.» The train was meant to leave at 9:15 but leaves later, so the delay is the extra waiting time.
explain: Delay can also be a doing word. To delay means to make something happen later, or to make someone late. It can also mean to wait before doing something. The words around it show which meaning you need.
explain: The word turns up in many places. In online games, lag is a delay between what you press and what happens. Doctors need clear information, because «leaving out how a pain feels or where it moved can delay the right treatment.» When something matters, you act without delay.
fact: A delay, as a noun, is a time when something happens later than planned.
fact: To delay, as a verb, means to make something happen later, or to make someone late.
fact: To delay can also mean to wait before doing something.
fact: «Lag» is a delay between what you press and what happens in an online game.
fact: Useful phrases: without delay (straight away), a short delay, delayed by, and flight delay.
exercise: «There is a delay to the 9:15 train.» What does delay mean in this sentence? | The name of the train | *The extra time before the train leaves | The driver's lunch break | The station's ticket office
exercise: Doctors say «leaving out how a pain feels or where it moved can delay the right treatment.» What does delay mean here? | To stop the pain forever | To make the treatment happen faster | To write the treatment down | *To make the treatment happen later
exercise: Which phrase means straight away? | flight delay | delayed by | *without delay | a short delay
test: Which word means to make something happen later? | *delay | station | announce | ticket
test: Which sentence uses delay as a doing word? | *The storm may delay our flight. | The train had a long delay. | A delay is very annoying. | The delay was on the board.
exam: In an online game, what is lag? | *A delay between pressing a button and what happens | A new player on your team | A sound effect | A kind of game
